{"results":[{"url":"https://x.com/mdhmwssb/status/1316987375491239936","final_url":"https://x.com/MDHMWSSB/status/1316987375491239936","title":"K Ashok Reddy, IAS (@MDHMWSSB) on X","description":"If your household water storage sump is mixed with rain water, pl empty it and clean & disinfect with  bleaching powder and refill sump with HMWSSB water. As precaution pl mix the water with chlorine tablets. Chlorine tablets are distributed by HMWSSB staff at your doorstep.","language":"en","text":"## Post\n\nLog inSign up\n\n## Post\n\nLog inSign up\n\n# K Ashok Reddy, IAS on X: \"If your household water storage sump is mixed with rain water, pl empty it and clean & disinfect with bleaching powder and refill sump with HMWSSB water. As precaution pl mix the water with chlorine tablets. Chlorine tablets are distributed by HMWSSB staff at your doorstep.\"\n\n## Conversation\n\nK Ashok Reddy, IAS\n\n@MDHMWSSB\n\nIf your household water storage sump is mixed with rain water, pl empty it and clean & disinfect with bleaching powder and refill sump with HMWSSB water. As precaution pl mix the water with chlorine tablets. Chlorine tablets are distributed by HMWSSB staff at your doorstep.\n\n6:20 AM · Oct 16, 2020\n\n7","author":"https://x.com/MDHMWSSB","published_date":"2020-10-16T06:20:33.000Z","latency_ms":815.0519659975544,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}